<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Application Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .section-header { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">Application for Admission under the Agreement on Graduate Education – The University of Missouri-Kansas City (UMKC), the Board of Regents of the State of Kansas, and the University of Kansas Medical Center (KUMC)</h2>
  <p>Students are enrolled at both the home and host institution, and pay tuition and fees at the host institution for the course(s) enrolled in under this agreement. Students enrolling at KUMC pay online in the Enroll and Pay system. Students enrolling at KUMC will receive instructions about using Enroll and Pay to pay tuition/fees and how to access the KUMC network/email account from the Graduate Studies Office. Students enrolling at UMKC pay tuition/fees at the Cashier's Office, 112 Administrative Center or online through the UMKC website.</p>
  <p>Deadlines for submitting applications are: <span data-field="application_deadline_1">{{ application_deadline_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="application_deadline_2">{{ application_deadline_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="application_deadline_3">{{ application_deadline_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="application_deadline_4">{{ application_deadline_4 }}</span>.</p>
  <p>It is the student's responsibility to request and pay for a transcript to be sent from the host institution to the home institution if needed.</p>

  <div class="section-header">Student completes this section. Make sure all sections are completed and print clearly:</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 25%;">Social Security Number</td>
        <td style="width: 25%;">Student # Home Institution</td>
        <td style="width: 25%;">Student # Host Institution (to be completed by Host Institution)</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Name</td>
        <td><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="first_name">{{ first_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="middle_name">{{ middle_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="last_name">{{ last_name }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Current Address</td>
        <td><span data-field="current_address">{{ current_address }}</span></td>
        <td>City: <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span></td>
        <td>State: <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span></td>
        <td>Zip: <span data-field="zip">{{ zip }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Phone (____)</td>
        <td><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></td>
        <td>E-Mail Address: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></td>
        <td>Date of Birth: <span data-field="dob">{{ dob }}</span></td>
        <td>Mo/Day/Year</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Are you an international Student?</td>
        <td><span data-field="international_student_yes_no">{{ international_student_yes_no }}</span></td>
        <td>Visa Type (if applicable)</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Signature of Representative from Home Institutions International Student Office for students on a Visa:</td>
        <td><span data-field="signature_rep_home">{{ signature_rep_home }}</span></td>
        <td>Date: <span data-field="date_rep_home">{{ date_rep_home }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Print name of representative from International Student Office</td>
        <td><span data-field="print_name_rep_home">{{ print_name_rep_home }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Degree(s) sought: at home institution</td>
        <td><span data-field="degree_sought_home">{{ degree_sought_home }}</span></td>
        <td>ENROLLMENT REQUESTED FOR:</td>
        <td>FALL <span data-field="enrollment_fall">{{ enrollment_fall }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Department at home institution</td>
        <td><span data-field="department_home">{{ department_home }}</span></td>
        <td>SPRING <span data-field="enrollment_spring">{{ enrollment_spring }}</span></td>
        <td>SUMMER <span data-field="enrollment_summer">{{ enrollment_summer }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>* This agreement includes all graduate degree programs excluding <span data-field="excluded_programs">{{ excluded_programs }}</span>.</p>
  <p>UMKC students attending at least one course at KUMC must complete the following requirements and obtain the appropriate signatures prior to presenting an application to the KUMC Office of Graduate Studies:</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Signature of KUMC Student Health Representative*:</td>
      <td><span data-field="sig_health_rep_kumc">{{ sig_health_rep_kumc }}</span></td>
      <td>Date: <span data-field="date_health_rep_kumc">{{ date_health_rep_kumc }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>* Students are required to submit immunization, health history, and physical examination records. Contact Student Health at <span data-field="health_contact_info">{{ health_contact_info }}</span>.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Signature of Health Insurance Representative*:</td>
      <td><span data-field="sig_insurance_rep_kumc">{{ sig_insurance_rep_kumc }}</span></td>
      <td>Date: <span data-field="date_insurance_rep_kumc">{{ date_insurance_rep_kumc }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>* Students must provide proof of health insurance. For more details, go to the health insurance website at <span data-field="insurance_website">{{ insurance_website }}</span>.</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p>Note: I understand that my enrollment in the course(s) shown on this form is subject to the availability of class space at the time of my registration and I am responsible for all tuition and fees assessed by the host institution.</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Student Signature</td>
      <td><span data-field="student_signature">{{ student_signature }}</span></td>
      <td>Date</td>
      <td><span data-field="student_date">{{ student_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">Office of Graduate Studies of HOME Institution completes this section. Please be sure all questions are answered:</h2>
  <p>This is to certify that the above named individual is a Graduate Student in good standing at this institution. He/She has our permission to take the following course(s) at the:</p>
  <p>University of Missouri - Kansas City</p>
  <p>University of Kansas Medical Center</p>
  <p>The course(s) taken under this agreement count as resident credit toward graduation. Maximum of six credit hours per semester. This course(s) is a part of the student's graduate program or a prerequisite for the program.</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Course Title</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">Subject</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Catalog #</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Class #</td>
        <td style="width: 15%;">Credit Hours</td>
        <td style="width: 15%;">Instructor</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in course_details %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ course_details[loop.index0].title }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].subject">{{ course_details[loop.index0].subject }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].catalog_number">{{ course_details[loop.index0].catalog_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].class_number">{{ course_details[loop.index0].class_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].credit_hours">{{ course_details[loop.index0].credit_hours }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].instructor">{{ course_details[loop.index0].instructor }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-header">GTA/RA/GRA Appointment Information:</div>
  <p>Student is eligible for GTA/RA/GRA appointment for the semester of enrollment under this agreement: <span data-field="gta_ra_gra_eligible_yes_no">{{ gta_ra_gra_eligible_yes_no }}</span></p>
  <p>This GTA/GRA/GRA appointment must meet the minimum qualifications for the waiver of non-resident tuition at the HOME SCHOOL.</p>
  <p>Comments:</p>
  <p><span data-field="comments_gta_ra_gra">{{ comments_gta_ra_gra }}</span></p>

  <p>This applicant is eligible for enrollment at host institution <span data-field="host_eligible_yes_no">{{ host_eligible_yes_no }}</span></p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Graduate Advisor Signature:</td>
      <td><span data-field="advisor_signature">{{ advisor_signature }}</span></td>
      <td>Print Name: <span data-field="advisor_print_name">{{ advisor_print_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Phone # and E-mail Address:</td>
      <td><span data-field="advisor_contact_info">{{ advisor_contact_info }}</span></td>
      <td>Date of Approval: <span data-field="advisor_date_approval">{{ advisor_date_approval }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Dean of Graduate School Signature:</td>
      <td><span data-field="dean_signature">{{ dean_signature }}</span></td>
      <td>Print Name: <span data-field="dean_print_name">{{ dean_print_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Phone # and E-mail Address:</td>
      <td><span data-field="dean_contact_info">{{ dean_contact_info }}</span></td>
      <td>Date of Approval: <span data-field="dean_date_approval">{{ dean_date_approval }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-header">Registrar's Office of HOME institution completes this section:</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Student is:</td>
      <td><span data-field="registrar_student_type">{{ registrar_student_type }}</span></td>
      <td>Non Resident for Tuition Purposes</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p>*ATTENTION STUDENT: If you are a Non-Resident at the home school but live in the state of the host school, you may qualify for resident tuition rates. Contact the Registrar's Office at the Host Institution for more details.</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Home Registrar Signature:</td>
      <td><span data-field="registrar_signature">{{ registrar_signature }}</span></td>
      <td>Print Name: <span data-field="registrar_print_name">{{ registrar_print_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Phone and E-mail Address:</td>
      <td><span data-field="registrar_contact_info">{{ registrar_contact_info }}</span></td>
      <td>Date of Approval: <span data-field="registrar_date_approval">{{ registrar_date_approval }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p>Send completed application to the appropriate HOST school at the address below:</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">UMKC</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">UMKC</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Marcia Jones</td>
      <td>Registration and Records</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Director of Graduate Studies -</td>
      <td>University of Missouri - Kansas City</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>University of Kansas Medical Center</td>
      <td>115 Administrative Center</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Mail Stop 4009</td>
      <td>5115 Oak Street</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Kansas City, KS 66160</td>
      <td>Kansas City, MO 64110</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

</body>
</html>